-----          STANDARD VERIFICATION RULE FILE COMPILATION MODULE          -----
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

--- RULE FILE = lvs.svrf

PRECISION 1000
UNIT LENGTH U
RESOLUTION 1
LAYOUT SYSTEM GDSII
LAYOUT PATH "layout.gds"
LAYOUT PRIMARY CLK-CMP
SOURCE SYSTEM SPICE
SOURCE PATH "source.sp"
SOURCE PRIMARY CLK-CMP
LVS REPORT "device_lvs.rep"
LVS POWER NAME VDD VPWR
LVS GROUND NAME VSS GND VGND
LVS RECOGNIZE GATES NONE
LAYER POLY 1
LAYER NWELL 2
LAYER FIN 3
LAYER ACTIVE 5
LAYER NSEL 7
LAYER PSEL 8
LAYER LISD 98
LAYER PC 99
LAYER PB 150
LAYER V0 12
LAYER M1 13
LAYER V1 14
LAYER M2 15
LAYER V2 16
LAYER M3 19
LAYER V3 17
LAYER M4 21
LAYER V4 22
LAYER M5 23
LAYER V5 24
LAYER M6 25
BULK = EXTENT
PSUB = BULK NOT NWELL
BODY = ACTIVE AND PB
N_BODY = BODY AND NSEL
P_BODY = BODY AND PSEL
A = ACTIVE NOT PB
NA = A AND NSEL
PA = A AND PSEL
NG = POLY AND NA
PG = POLY AND PA
NSD = NA NOT POLY
PSD = PA NOT POLY
CONNECT M6 M5 BY V5
CONNECT M5 M4 BY V4
CONNECT M4 M3 BY V3
CONNECT M3 M2 BY V2
CONNECT M2 M1 BY V1
CONNECT M1 LISD BY V0
CONNECT M1 PC BY V0
CONNECT PC POLY
CONNECT LISD NSD
CONNECT LISD PSD
CONNECT LISD N_BODY
CONNECT LISD P_BODY
CONNECT N_BODY PSUB
CONNECT P_BODY NWELL
DEVICE MN(n) NG POLY NSD NSD PSUB
DEVICE MP(p) PG POLY PSD PSD NWELL
TEXT LAYER M1 M2 M3 M4 M5 M6
PORT LAYER TEXT M1 M2 M3 M4 M5 M6
TEXT DEPTH PRIMARY

LVS INJECT LOGIC NO
TRACE PROPERTY MN(n) L L 0
TRACE PROPERTY MP(p) L L 0

TRACE PROPERTY MN(n) W W 0
TRACE PROPERTY MP(p) W W 0

LVS CHECK PORT NAMES YES

LVS PROPERTY RESOLUTION MAXIMUM 200


--- STANDARD VERIFICATION RULE FILE COMPILATION MODULE COMPLETED.



